01:09:57.235 --> 01:10:00.113
I'm guessing you don't miss your legs.


01:10:00.321 --> 01:10:02.740
Not one bit. Heh.


01:10:04.909 --> 01:10:06.953
Come back and visit us'?


01:10:07.745 --> 01:10:09.205
